Cassius ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງຢ່າງຂ້ອນຂ້າງ, ບໍ່ສະບາຍໃຈ ຫລີກລ້ຽງ.

65
00:05:06,350 --> 00:05:09,850
[CASSIUS]
He was supposed to kill me.   Well, I'm still alive.
ບໍ່, ຜູ້ຊາຍ, ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າ... ໃນ L'ville,
ໃນເວລາທີ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າເຕີບໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ, ພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າເກືອບບໍ່ໃຫ້ຄົນຜິວ ດໍາ ຂັບລົດເມ.

66
00:05:10,350 --> 00:05:12,350
[THE BELL.    CASSIUS]
literally ambles into the corner.
ປອນຂອງຫຍັງ?

67
00:05:12,850 --> 00:05:18,850
[LISTON'S LEFT]
comes in like a freight train. Cassius merely leans away to avoid Liston, circles and now snaps off a flurry and OPENS A CUT UNDER SONNY'S LEFT EYE. Then, he splits out of there.
ສືບຕໍ່ເວົ້າ, ຄົນຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອເປື່ອຍ,
ຂ້ອຍຈະຂັບຂີ່ເຈົ້າຄືວ່າຂ້ອຍເປັນພໍ່ຂອງເຈົ້າ...

68
00:05:19,350 --> 00:05:22,850
[ANNOUNCER]
He's opened a cut on Liston. Liston's never been cut!
ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ວ່າຂ້ອຍບໍ່ແມ່ນໃຜ... ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ໄດ້ດື່ມ... ກັບຄືນໄປຫາເມຍຂອງຂ້ອຍ.
.. ຂ້ອຍຈະບໍ່ອະທິຖານຕໍ່ພຣະເຢຊູທີ່ມີຕາສີຟ້າແລະຜົມສີເທົາ... ຂ້ອຍບໍ່...

69
00:05:23,350 --> 00:05:25,350
[CASSIUS]
He's nothin' to me...
ບໍ່ຂອບໃຈ.

70
00:05:25,850 --> 00:05:27,850
[CASSIUS]
And he knows it...
ຊອນນີ ລີສຕັນ: ເຈົ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນແຊ້ມ! ເຈົ້າເປັນຄົນໂງ່!
ເຈົ້າຢາກສູນເສຍເງິນຂອງເຈົ້າ, ນັດໃສ່ຊອນນີ. ລາວຮູ້ວ່າຂ້ອຍດີ. ລາວຈະໄປໃນ 8!

71
00:05:28,350 --> 00:05:34,300
[CLOSE:   CASSIUS]
blinks back something...we're not sure what. It seems to go away. Then it's back. The fight continues...
...ອາຫານແລງ!

72
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:39,700
[WIDER:   CASSIUS]
dominating. They clinch. They break. This time Cassius violently blinks his eyes! Something's wrong!
ຕໍ່ໄປ.

73
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:42,200
[CASSIUS]
...my eyes!
ແລະຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄດ້ຍິນວ່າທ່ານຈະມາ.

74
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:45,500
[CASSIUS]
My eyes! I can't see...somethin' in my eyes!
ເຈົ້າແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າເຮັດໄດ້ບໍ່...?

75
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:48,450
[CASSIUS]
Cut 'em off! Cut 'em!   I'm blind.
ເຈົ້າເວົ້າວ່າ ຂ້ອຍຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບລາວບໍ?

76
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:54,950
[ANGELO DUNDEE]
No. You quit, it's over! Get out there. Be a yardstick. This is the big one, daddy. Get out there and run!
ມີຫຍັງຜິດກັບທະນາຍຄວາມ ແລະຜູ້ຈັດການຂອງທ່ານ?

77
00:05:55,450 --> 00:06:01,450
[CLOSER:   CASSIUS' EYES]
With a minute left, now, he sees better. Liston throws him into a corner, still trying to put him away. But, he can't, and Liston's energy seems to deflate once he knows that. The BELL.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ.

78
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:06,850
[HOWARD COSELL]
...Clay, a round ago, looked like he'd about had it, but in round six...
ພໍ່ຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຕາມ Sonja Henie.

79
00:06:07,350 --> 00:06:13,350
[HOWARD COSELL]
Sonny Liston is not coming out! Wait a minute! Wait a minute! Sonny Liston is not coming out!
ຂ້ອຍເຮັດໃຫ້ໂລກໂສກເສົ້າ! ຂ້ອຍເປັນຄົນຍິ່ງໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ!

80
00:06:13,850 --> 00:06:18,050
[HOWARD COSELL]
The winner...and the new heavyweight champion of the world is Cassius Clay!
Malcolm ໄດ້ໄປສູ່ໂລກທີ່ບໍ່ມີພຸດທະສາດ ແລະບໍ່ໄດ້ວັດແທກຄໍາເວົ້າຂອງລາວ
ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕັດສິນໃຈໃຫ້ທ່ານ, ເປັນຄູ່ມືຂອງທ່ານ, ລູກຊາຍຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າເອງ, Herbert Muhammad.

81
00:06:18,550 --> 00:06:22,750
[CASSIUS]
I upset the world! I am the greatest! I am the greatest!
ໄປກໍຕາມ ຢ່າເລື່ອນເວລາ ມັນບໍ່ປອດໄພຢູ່ນີ້

82
00:06:23,250 --> 00:06:25,350
[CASSIUS]
Eat your words! Eat your words!
ແມ່...ອາບນ້ ໍາ ພ້ອມແລ້ວ...

83
00:06:25,850 --> 00:06:28,300
[HOWARD COSELL]
What made him so easy for you?
ລໍຖ້າຊົ່ວໂມງ...

84
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:31,250
[CASSIUS]
I told you. Didn't I tell you?
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ.

85
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:35,250
[HOWARD COSELL]
Was there any single point you knew you had him?
"ຊາວມຸສລິມຜິວດໍາ" ແມ່ນຄໍາສັບຂອງສື່ມວນຊົນ...

86
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:41,700
[CASSIUS]
I had him in the first round. 'Cause I'm the greatest!  Sam... Hey, Sam! Let him up.
ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາອອກໄປ?

87
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:48,200
[CASSIUS]
I am the greatest! And he the greatest rock 'n' roll singer. Sam Cooke! I want everybody to bear witness.  I shook up the world! Don't have a mark on me! I was burning. I was blind. I'm the prettiest thing that ever lived. I shook up the world! I shook up the world!
ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້, Côte d'Ivoire, ອາຟຣິກາ.

88
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:54,700
[GORDON DAVIDSON]
...I don't care what should have been ordered! We need a victory party right now.  I got national press, the family, the champ, all kinds of folks...  250 to 300. Yes.
ມັນເປັນຫຍັງ?

89
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,200
[GIRL]
Why's he so scared?
ຄົ້ນຄວ້າເບິ່ງ, ພວກເຮົາຈະເອົາ ມາລຄອມ ໃນລີເບເຣຍເອງ.

90
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:59,800
[MALCOLM X]
Man, look at that guy run!
ວາວ...

91
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:06,300
[CASSIUS]
The Mummy! "I can't get away from the mummy!" Yeah, but that mummy too slow to catch anybody.
ດື່ມຈາກນໍ້ານໍ້າຂອງ Zem-Zem... ແລະເຈົ້າຄວນໄປຢ້ຽມຢາມ
Cairo. ຂ້ອຍມີຫມູ່ເພື່ອນຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນໃນ...

92
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:09,250
[SAM COOKE]
Hey!   The mummy always gets his man...
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ...

93
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:13,250
[CASSIUS]
No, he don't!  Now, don't believe that stuff on television...
ຂ້ອຍຈະພາເຈົ້າໄປ...

94
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:19,350
[A REPORTER]
The people look to you. Do you plan on being a people's champ, like Joe Louis?
ມີສະປາຍ ແລະສິ່ງອື່ນໆ.

95
00:07:19,850 --> 00:07:24,750
[CASSIUS]
Yeah. I going to be a people's champ...  But not like Joe Louis, exactly...
ເຈົ້າໄປໃສ?

96
00:07:25,250 --> 00:07:27,250
[A REPORTER]
Mr. Clay...?
ພໍ່...ສໍາລັບເຈົ້າ...

97
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:33,750
[CASSIUS]
And I'm not Clay. Clay's the name of the people who owned by ancestors. I don't want to be called after that slave name no more. So I'm "X." Cassius X. And I'm a member of the Nation of Islam. The Honorable Elijah Muhammad is my spiritual guide. Malcolm X is my mentor.
ມັນເປັນຫຍັງ, ໂຈເຊັບ?

98
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:37,750
[REPORTERS]
You a card-carrying member?    Aren't Black Muslims a hate group?
ທ່ານ Elijah Muhammad ຜູ້ມີກຽດ ໄດ້ຂໍໃຫ້ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າແຈ້ງໃຫ້ທ່ານຊາບວ່າ
ການໂຈະຂອງທ່ານ ໄດ້ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໄປຢ່າງບໍ່ມີກໍານົດ.

99
00:07:38,250 --> 00:07:44,250
[CASSIUS]
"Card-carrying"...? Don't need no "card." You got a Christian card? 750 million people believe in Islam. I'm one of them.
ມີຫຍັງອີກ?

100
00:07:44,750 --> 00:07:49,300
[ANOTHER REPORTER]
Minister Malcolm...what about the reports of a split between you and Elijah Muhammad?
...ເມື່ອຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄດ້ຍິນກ່ຽວກັບເດັກຍິງສີ່ຄົນ ທີ່ຖືກວາງລະເບີດ ໃນໂບດຖະຫນົນ 16 ໃນ Birmingham? ການຫ້າມຂອງຜູ້ມີກຽດ Elijah Muhammad ໄດ້ກີດຂວາງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຈາກການເວົ້າສຽງຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໃນການກະທໍາ. ເພາະວ່າ Birmingham
ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫນຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສິດທິພົນລະເມືອງ, ຂໍອະທິຖານສໍາລັບສະຖານທີ່ຢູ່ໂຕະຂອງຜູ້ຊາຍສີຂາວ... ແຕ່ເດັກນ້ອຍຕາຍ... ແມ່ນເດັກນ້ອຍຕາຍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວາມໂກດແຄ້ນທີ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຮູ້ສຶກ, ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຕ້ອງກີດກັນ. ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄດ້ລັອກລົງ! ແຂນຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ

101
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:55,800
[MALCOLM X]
This is the champ's time. And I'm here as a friend to celebrate his victory. So I got nothing you want...
ຮາ? ເຈົ້າເຮັດແນວໃດ? ຍ່າງຂ້າມຖູ...shazaam...ເຈົ້າເປັນຊາວມຸສລິມບໍ?

102
00:07:56,300 --> 00:08:02,300
[CASSIUS]
I'm going to be a people's champion. But I don't have to be the way you want me to be. I'm gonna be what I want. And I'm free to think any way I want...
ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຄວນໄດ້......ຂັດແຍ່ງກັບ Elijah Muhammad ທີ່ເຄົາລົບ...

103
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:06,300
[MALCOLM X]
I was leaving, saw the light on...how come you're up?
ເປັນຫຍັງເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງຢາກປ່ຽນ?

104
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:10,300
[CASSIUS]
...watchin' a show on termites...they knockin' down this house, here.
ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້...

105
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:15,350
[MALCOLM X]
I been invited to speak at Ibadan University in Nigeria. C'mon with me?
ໄປຫາສະຫນາມກິລາ. ພວກນັກໂທດ 6 ຄົນນຸ່ງເສື້ອອາຊີບ.

106
00:08:15,850 --> 00:08:19,700
[CASSIUS]
Six million in your house and you don't know it. Where?
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ...

107
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:22,200
[MALCOLM X]
Africa.   You been there?
ພຽງແຕ່ຫຼັງຈາກການບໍລິການທີ່ຍາວນານ ແລະຜົນງານສູງໃນການເກີດໃຫມ່ທາງດ້ານຈິດວິນຍານ ແລະຮ່າງກາຍຂອງປະຊາຊົນອາຟຣິກາ-ອາເມຣິກາ... ແມ່ນຄົນຫນຶ່ງໄດ້ຮັບຊື່ຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ແຕ່ທ່ານແມ່ນພິເສດ. ເປັນແຊ້ມໂລກ.
ສະນັ້ນມີຂອງຂວັນທີ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຢາກໃຫ້ທ່ານ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ວັນນີ້ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປທ່ານຈະຮູ້ກັນວ່າ Muhammad Ali... ຊຶ່ງຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າ"ຜູ້ທີ່ສົມຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການຍ້ອງຍໍຊົມເຊີຍ", ແລະ Ali ຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າ"ສູງສຸດ".

108
00:08:22,700 --> 00:08:25,500
[CASSIUS]
Africa? No. Only Rome.      Yeah, man, let's go!
Malcolm ໄດ້ພົບກັບ Cassius Clay, Muhammad
Ali ຫຼືວ່າລາວເອີ້ນຕົວເອງວ່າແນວໃດ

109
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:31,950
[MALCOLM X]
Nkrumah stayed with me when he was a student in New York, so we'll stop in Ghana...
ເພິ່ນເວົ້າຫຍັງ?

110
00:08:32,450 --> 00:08:34,450
[CASSIUS]
When we leaving?
ນັ້ນແມ່ນຄໍາຫມັ້ນສັນຍາບໍ?

111
00:08:34,950 --> 00:08:36,950
[MALCOLM X]
Next Thursday.
...ບໍ່ຄວນໄດ້ໂຕ້ຖຽງກັບທ່ານອີເລຢາ...

112
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:39,450
[CASSIUS]
What is it?
...ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນໄດ້ສັ່ງ! ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການງານລ້ຽງໄຊຊະນະໃນເວລານີ້.
ຂ້ອຍມີສື່ມວນຊົນທົ່ວປະເທດ, ຄອບຄົວ, ແຊ້ມ, ປະຊາຊົນທຸກຊະນິດ... 250 ຫາ 300. ແມ່ນແລ້ວ.

113
00:08:39,950 --> 00:08:44,500
[MALCOLM X]
You ever been so angry...have you ever been so angry that you'd explode?
ປິດຜົມຂ້ອຍ ບໍ່ໃສ່ເຄື່ອງແຕ່ງກາຍ
ນຸ່ງເສອແຂນຍາວຫວານເອີຍ ເຈົ້າເປັນ virgin ບໍ?

114
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:51,000
[CASSIUS]
Tore out a picture of Emmett Till when I was little. Couldn't take my eyes to it...couldn't look at it. Barb-wire around his neck to a 75- pound cotton-gin fan. Took out his eye. The cruelty to it...I couldn't look at it...couldn't throw it away.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ມີພຽງຄົນດຽວທີ່ສະຫຼາດ ຄົນໃສ່ແວ່ນຕາ

115
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:53,500
[MALCOLM X]
What else?
ເດືອນພະຈິກ.

116
00:08:54,000 --> 00:09:00,000
[CASSIUS]
I thought, "What I do wrong to be so low that people could do that to people like me?" It made me feel ashamed. And that makes no sense. But that's what it was.
ຜູ້ຊາຍ, ເບິ່ງຜູ້ຊາຍທີ່ແລ່ນ!

117
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:06,500
[MALCOLM X]
...when I heard about the four girls bombed in the 16th Street Church in Birmingham?  The prohibitions of the Honorable Elijah Muhammad prevented me from speaking my voice in action. Because Birmingham was part of the civil rights movement, begging for a place at the white man's table... But dead children...are dead children. So the anger I felt, I had to contain. I locked that down! So tight my muscles seized. I lost control over the right side of my body. Leg didn't work...right arm didn't work. "I'm having a stroke," I thought. I had to hold it in 'cause I wanted, all I wanted was to BREAK SOMETHING! Break a part...any part of this system. Because you are so provoked as a human being. In your spirit. In your heart... At the death of children. But I COULD DO...nothing.
ລາວກຽດຊັງຄົນຜິວຂາວບໍ? ມາລຄອມເອັກສ
(Malcolm X) ຢູ່ເມືອງ ແລ້ວລາວກໍອອກໄປ

118
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:13,000
[MALCOLM X]
Everyone knows... Now I'm advocating more direct political action involvement with the international struggle... So Elijah Muhammad has suspended me as a Minister in the Nation of Islam for 90 days.
...ລາວເປັນຄົນທີ່ຂ້ອຍມັກທີ່ສຸດ.

119
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,500
[CASSIUS]
You can fix that...
ທ່ານໄດ້ເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້, ການຝຶກອົບຮົມ, Champ
ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ອຍອອກມາໃນເດັກຍິງນີ້ທັນທີ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຂ້ານາງ!

120
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:22,000
[MALCOLM X]
I don't know. I will try when we get back. Until then I will live each day as if I am already dead.
ຜູ້ຊາຍ, ຂ້ອຍຄວນໄປໃສ? ພວກເຮົາວາງແຜນໄປອີຈິບ.

121
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:28,500
[ELIJAH MUHAMMAD]
Only after long service and high merit in the spiritual and physical rebirth of Afro-American people...is one granted an original name. But you are special. A world champion. So there is a gift I wish to give you. From this day forward you will be known as Muhammad Ali...which means "one worthy of praise," and Ali means "most high."
Howard Cosell, ເຈົ້າເປັນຜູ້ກະຕຸ້ນ! ເຈົ້າເປັນແບບນີ້ໄດ້ແນວໃດ
? ເມື່ອຂ້ອຍເຮັດກັບລີສຕັນແລ້ວ, ຂ້ອຍຈະມາຫາເຈົ້າ!

122
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,450
[CASSIUS]
Muhammad Ali.  "Worthy of praise..." Thank you!
ມາລຄອມ?

123
00:09:31,950 --> 00:09:36,850
[ELIJAH MUHAMMAD]
Be very careful what you say...your words reflect on the nation of Islam, now.
ຂ້ອຍເອີ້ນວ່າ ບຸນດີນີ, ຄໍານັບກັບ ຮູດີນີ. ລາວເປັນຊາວຢິວເຊັ່ນກັນ
...ຄົນອື່ນເອີ້ນຂ້ອຍວ່າ Fastblack... ຫຼື Daddy Mac...

124
00:09:37,350 --> 00:09:39,350
[CASSIUS]
Yes, sir.
ຕໍ່ໄປ Cassius ໄດ້ສັກຢາໃສ່ຮ່າງກາຍສອງສາມຄັ້ງ, ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນການຖິ້ມ
, slides, dances, clinches, circles away... ຈົນກວ່າ...

125
00:09:39,850 --> 00:09:45,850
[ELIJAH MUHAMMAD]
Up until now, I have entrusted your spiritual development to Brother Malcolm.  I do not feel this is a wise course anymore.
ອ້າຍ Muhammad...

126
00:09:46,350 --> 00:09:52,350
[ELIJAH MUHAMMAD]
Malcolm has gone off into the secular world and does not measure his words. I have decided to give you, as your guide, my very own son, Herbert Muhammad.
Shorty ແມ່ນໃຜ?

127
00:09:52,850 --> 00:09:56,350
[ELIJAH MUHAMMAD]
Herbert will supervise all of your spiritual and material needs.
Sonji... Sonji Roi...

128
00:09:56,850 --> 00:09:58,950
[CASSIUS]
This is a great honor, Messenger...
ຄາຊີອສ (Cassius) ພຽງແຕ່ຫັນໄປຫລີກລ້ຽງ ລີສຕັນ, ວົງຈອນ
ແລະດຽວນີ້ໄດ້ແຕກຂຶ້ນແລະເປີດການຕັດພາຍໃຕ້ຕາຊ້າຍຂອງຊອນນີ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ລາວໄດ້ອອກໄປຈາກທີ່ນັ້ນ.

129
00:09:59,450 --> 00:10:01,450
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
Why you want to change?
ເປັນຫຍັງ?

130
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:05,800
[A NEIGHBOR]
Could we get a picture with you?  You mind, Mr. Clay?
ດຽວນີ້, ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງຖາມເຈົ້າ ເຈົ້າເຮັດການຕໍ່ສູ້ພວກນັ້ນບໍ? ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າກໍບໍ່ສາມາດບອກ Archie Moore ທີ່ຍິ່ງໃຫຍ່ວ່າເຈົ້າຈະເອົາລາວລົງໃນຮອບໃດ... ການຄາດຄະເນທັງ
ຫມົດ ທີ່ເຈົ້າເຮັດແມ່ນເກີດຂື້ນແທ້ໆ. ບໍ່ເຄີຍໄດ້ຍິນວ່າມີໃຜຄາດຄະ ເນຮອບເຊັ່ນເຈົ້າ. ເຈົ້າແມ່ນຕົວະ ຫຼື Shorty ຢູ່ແຈຂອງເຈົ້າ. ບອກຂ້ອຍຄວາມຈິງ, ຊາຍຫນຸ່ມ...

131
00:10:06,300 --> 00:10:09,450
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
What's wrong with the lawyers and managers you got?
ແລະລາວຮູ້ມັນ...

132
00:10:09,950 --> 00:10:11,950
[A NEIGHBOR]
One more.  Thank you.
ເພາະວ່າຂ້ອຍຈະເປັນແຮງບັນດານໃຈຂອງເຈົ້າ ຜູ້ຊຸກຍູ້ຂອງເຈົ້າ
ຢູ່ແຈຂອງເຈົ້າ ຂ້ອຍສາມາດຢູ່ແຈຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ບໍ່, ຊາຍຫນຸ່ມ?

133
00:10:12,450 --> 00:10:14,450
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
Yeah, yeah...
ຂ້ອຍກໍາລັງປ່ຽນເຄື່ອງນຸ່ງຂອງຂ້ອຍ ເຈົ້າບໍ່ມັກສິ່ງທີ່ຂ້ອຍໃສ່!

134
00:10:14,950 --> 00:10:20,200
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
You got...I got you the best white men I could find. Right here in L'ville...
ແລະຂ້າພະເຈົ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ Clay. Clay ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງປະຊາຊົນທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໂດຍບັນພະບຸລຸດ. ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນຕາມຊື່ຂອງຄົນຂ້າອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ສະນັ້ນຂ້າພະເຈົ້າແມ່ນ"X"
. Cassius X. ແລະຂ້າພະເຈົ້າເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງປະເທດຊາດຂອງອິສລາມ. Elijah Muhammad ທີ່ເຄົາລົບແມ່ນຄູ່ມືທາງວິນຍານຂອງຂ້ອຍ. Malcolm X ແມ່ນຜູ້ແນະນໍາຂອງຂ້ອຍ.

135
00:10:20,700 --> 00:10:26,700
[ALI]
When the contract run out. I want black lawyers and managers. Chauncey Eskridge on North La Salle Street...
ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຄວນໂຕ້ຖຽງກັບ ອີເລຢາ ໂມຮໍາແມດ.

136
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:33,200
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
They saved you from the gangsters, from the jackals and the hyenas of boxing. Never cheated you. Protected you with a trust fund...
Gamilah ຫຼື Khalilah ແນວໃດ?

137
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:38,950
[ALI]
I don't need no "protectin'" from myself. Why I need protecting from myself by them...?
...ເວົ້າທາງໂທລະສັບກັບເມຍຂອງລາວ
ນາງມີເວລາຍາກໃນການນອນ ເດັກນ້ອຍຂັບຫຼາຍ...

138
00:10:39,450 --> 00:10:45,400
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
And now I got to go tell them, "Piss off. Cassius don't want you around no more."
ນີ້ແມ່ນເວລາຂອງແຊ້ມ ແລະຂ້ອຍຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ເປັນເພື່ອນ
ເພື່ອສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງໄຊຊະນະຂອງລາວ ສະນັ້ນຂ້ອຍບໍ່ມີຫຍັງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ

139
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:51,900
[ALI]
I ain't one of their thoroughbreds! Or their charity things. "Let's do somethin' for that well-behaved colored boy, Cassius." I ain't well-behaved nothing! I am a man.
ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າເຈົ້າເປັນໃຜ...

140
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:57,300
[ALI]
And I am not Cassius. I changed my name. I am Muhammad Ali, now.
ໃນລົດຄາຣາວານ 3 ຄັນ, ຜ່ານບ່າໄຊຊະນະທີ່ຍິ່ງໃຫຍ່ດ້ວຍດາວສີດໍາມະຫາສານຢູ່ເທິງສຸດ.
ຫຼາຍພັນຄົນແຖວເສັ້ນທາງເພື່ອເບິ່ງແຊ້ມປະເພດຫນັກແລະຊົມເຊີຍລາວ. ສໍາລັບ Ali ມັນເປັນການເດີນຂະບວນອີກຊະນິດຫນຶ່ງ...

141
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,800
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
You what?
ສະບາຍດີ...?

142
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:02,300
[ALI]
That's right.
ເຮີ, ຜູ້ຊາຍ!!!

143
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:06,650
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
What? What's wrong with...our name, my name...? We're...we made you. We...
ບໍ່, ເຈົ້າອອກໄປແລ້ວ, ມັນຈົບລົງ! ອອກໄປບ່ອນນັ້ນ.
ເປັນເຄື່ອງວັດແທກ. ນີ້ແມ່ນອັນໃຫຍ່, ພໍ່. ອອກໄປທີ່ນັ້ນແລະແລ່ນ!

144
00:11:07,150 --> 00:11:09,150
[ALI]
No one "made me"...
ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ຕົກລົງກັບເຮີເບີດ ຂ້ອຍມີເຄື່ອງຫຼີ້ນດົນຕີໃນລົດຂອງຂ້ອຍ

145
00:11:09,650 --> 00:11:12,100
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
No bow-tie-wearin', Arab-talkin' nigger gonna change that...
ເມື່ອສັນຍາຫມົດອາຍຸ ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງການທະນາຍຄວາມແລະຜູ້ບໍລິຫານຜິວ
ດໍາ Chauncey Eskridge ໃນຖະຫນົນ North La Salle

146
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:16,100
[ALI]
I made me.  No one's in that ring but me!
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ແມ່ນ virgin... ແຕ່ຂ້ອຍອາດຈະເປັນເຊັ່ນກັນ. ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຂີ້ຕົມ! ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ສະເຫມີເມື່ອຂ້ອຍຮູ້. ເຫັນໃບຫນ້ານີ້ບໍ? ຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າ, ເຈົ້າມີໃບຫນ້າທີ່ສວຍງາມ ສໍາ
ລັບໃບຫນ້າຂອງເດັກຍິງ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າເຄີຍເຫັນສິ່ງໃດທີ່ງາມຄືກັບຂ້ອຍບໍ? ດຽວນີ້, ເຈົ້າປະມານ 5 ຟຸດ 3 ຟຸດ... ນັ້ນແມ່ນນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ. ແຕ່ຂ້ອຍເບິ່ງຂ້າມມັນ, ເພາະວ່າ...

147
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,700
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
You don't know who you are...
ປະມານນຶ່ງປີ ຂ້ອຍຂາຍ"Muhammad Speaks" ຜ່ານໂທລະສັບ

148
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:25,200
[ALI]
I know who I'm not...I'm not drinkin'! Goin' back on my wife! I am not prayin' to no blue-eyed, blonde-haired Jesus. I ain't...
ຊື່ແບບນັ້ນແມ່ນຫຍັງ?

149
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:31,700
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
Paintin' blue-eyed, blonde-haired Jesuses and signs on cars is what put steak and vegetables in you, clothes on you...
ຍ້ອນຈິດວິນຍານຂອງເຈົ້າ!

150
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:34,200
[ODESSA CLAY]
...dinner!
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ"ການປົກປ້ອງ" ຈາກຕົວເອງ
ເປັນຫຍັງຂ້ອຍຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປົກປ້ອງຈາກຕົວເອງໂດຍພວກເຂົາ...?

151
00:11:34,700 --> 00:11:36,700
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
Go ahead!
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ເພາະວ່າເຈົ້າມ່ວນຫລາຍເກີນໄປ!

152
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:39,200
[CASSIUS CLAY, SR.]
Go ahead.
ເຄື່ອງຫຼີ້ນບັນທຶກ? ສະບາຍດີ. ເປັນຫຍັງມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໂດດ?

153
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:45,700
[ODESSA CLAY]
